# Files and directories excluded from the wordpress.org distribution zip.
#
# Consumed by bin/build-zip.sh as rsync --exclude-from patterns. Anything listed
# here is present in the repository but must not reach wordpress.org.
#
# Plugin Check on the working tree reports 988 errors. 877 of those are in
# bundled-addons/ and _do_not_use_ai-imagen_/ alone, and a further 40 in docs/
# and the stray zip. Excluding what follows is what takes the packaged plugin
# from 988 errors to the ~71 that are in code we actually ship.

# --- Version control and build tooling ---
.git
.gitignore
.distignore
.github
bin
node_modules

# --- wordpress.org listing assets ---
# screenshot-N.png, banners and icons belong in the SVN /assets directory, which
# is a sibling of /trunk and is never part of the plugin itself. Shipping them
# inside the zip would add weight to every install for no benefit.
.wordpress-org

# --- OS and editor artefacts ---
# .DS_Store files are a Plugin Check error (hidden_files); three exist in the tree
# because the plugin is developed inside Dropbox.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.log

# --- Add-ons: out of scope for this release ---
# AI-Imagen, AI-Stats and AI-Pulse are not tested and not shipping. They carry
# 648 Plugin Check errors, 751 of the tree's text-domain mismatches among them,
# and several web-reachable scripts with no direct-access protection.
#
# NOTE: admin/class-ai-core-addons.php installs from this directory at lines 165
# and 414. That screen must stop offering these add-ons before a zip built with
# this exclusion is released, or Install will fail against a missing path.
bundled-addons

# --- Abandoned copy, name says as much ---
_do_not_use_ai-imagen_

# --- Developer documentation ---
# Not for end users. Also the source of four badly_named_files errors (spaces in
# filenames, "TESTING_GUIDE copy.md") and it contains the stale pre-0.3 readme.
docs
AI_MODELS.md

# --- Stray build artefact committed by accident ---
ai-imagen 12.56.56.zip

# --- Developer-only scripts sitting at the plugin root ---
# Web-reachable, unauthenticated, and not part of the product. 7 Plugin Check
# errors between them.
check_db.php
ai-core-prompt-library-diagnostic.php
